<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>You're Invited!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #1E2A44;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    .content p {
        margin: 0 0 1em 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .content strong {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        color: #1E2A44;
    }
    .disclaimer {
        font-size: 0.8em;
        color: #888888;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 15px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888888;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>You're Invited!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <%= guestName %>,</p>
      <p>We are delighted to invite you to our wedding celebration!</p>
      <p>You can access all the details and RSVP on our website. Your personal access code is:</p>
      <p><strong><%= accessCode %></strong></p>
      <p>Please visit our website and use this code to log in:</p>
      <p><a href="<%= loginUrl %>"><%= loginUrl %></a></p>
      <p>Just a friendly reminder that the last day to submit or edit your RSVP is <strong>September 17th, 2025</strong>.</p>
      
      <% if (inviteGroup === 'bridesmaids' || inviteGroup === 'groomsmen') { %>
        <p>As a member of the <%= inviteGroup %>, you have access to a special page with more details. Please be sure to check the "<%= inviteGroup.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + inviteGroup.slice(1) %>" page on the website regularly for updates.</p>
      <% } %>

      <p>Feel free to reply to this email if you have any questions.</p>
      <p>We also recommend checking the website regularly for any new updates or details as we get closer to the big day.</p>
      <p>We can't wait to celebrate with you!</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br>Veronica & Bishoy</p>
      <p class="disclaimer">
        If you have received this email in error, please disregard it and delete it immediately.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2025 Veronica & Bishoy. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
